      "lineNbr": 305,
      "author": {
        "id": 1944400
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-14T22:55:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "i get that, but, as i said, i think it will cause confusion once restricted_memfd is added, especially if some pKVM code in crosvm decides to start using the bit, then we\u0027ll have a mess to untangle\n\n`protection_type.isolates_memory()` is not ever going to imply restricted_memfd (at least not in any time frame worth considering at this point)",
      "parentUuid": "1e789447_20fc7d1e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 305,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 305,
        "endChar": 68
      },
      "revId": "6a5227c838d6b145748066348a5b49a3de68a2aa",
