        "id": 1858345
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-14T23:35:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Do you have a different idea?\n\nI don\u0027t have other different idea for communicating the kernel support. I think there\u0027s a two part decision. Part of the decision is kernel support (via a hypervisor capability). The other part I thought would just be \"isolates_memory()\"",
      "parentUuid": "2dd70294_1fb01691",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 305,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 305,
        "endChar": 68
      },
